                    {
                        "sense_id": "c615185a-9726-33ed-821e-8d762936bc40",
                        "entry_id": "2b2207f7-d757-34d2-b622-5eaca7bae8b9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to live (repeatedly or frequently); iterative of жить (žitʹ)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "37a748da-59f5-45cf-bbfb-72d8ac3fc57b",
                                "sense_id": "c615185a-9726-33ed-821e-8d762936bc40",
                                "text": "Те из мои́х чита́телей, кото́рые не жива́ли в дере́внях, не мо́гут себе́ вообрази́ть, что за пре́лесть э́ти уе́здные ба́рышни!",
                                "translation": "Those of my readers who have never lived in the country cannot imagine how charming these provincial young ladies are!",
                                "english": "Those of my readers who have never lived in the country cannot imagine how charming these provincial young ladies are!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
